INT. DECOMMISSIONED PLANETARIUM - CORPORATE RETREAT - DAY

A great hollow dome, peeling and blue, its star projector slumped like a dead insect in the center of the floor. Folding chairs form a circle beneath a painted Milky Way. A banner reads TEAM ASCENT.

LORRAINE FAIRWEATHER (50s, facilitator, silk scarf, voice made of honey) stands beside an easel. GIDEON OKPARA (40s, sales director, ironed jeans) slouches on a chair, ankle on knee. MIKA TANAKA-BELL (late 20s, analyst, sweating through a blazer) clutches a coffee. SEBASTIAN VOGT (60s, CFO, wire spectacles) sits as if posing for a portrait. PERPETUA ALVAREZ (30s, HR, lanyard, tight smile) guards the exit.

She uncaps a marker and draws a star on the easel.

LORRAINE
Gideon. What is the one word that describes your role?

GIDEON
Closer.

LORRAINE
Mika?

MIKA
Um. Fine?

LORRAINE
Be bolder, Mika.

MIKA
Fine... ly bolder?

Sebastian removes his spectacles and polishes them.

SEBASTIAN
Lorraine, when does the feedback session begin?

LORRAINE
That is the session, Sebastian.

SEBASTIAN
Ah.

Perpetua taps her watch. Nobody notices.

LORRAINE
Now. Each of you will name the person on your left and say one true thing.

Mika turns toward Gideon. Gideon turns toward Sebastian. Sebastian turns toward Perpetua. Perpetua turns toward Lorraine, who, in turn, faces Mika. The circle closes.

GIDEON
Sebastian. You sign my expenses without reading them.

SEBASTIAN
Perpetua. You have been planning your resignation for eleven weeks.

PERPETUA
Lorraine. This planetarium has no heat.

LORRAINE
Mika. You are the best of us.

Mika bursts into tears, then into laughter. Gideon cracks first. Then Sebastian, a dry wheeze. Perpetua covers her mouth. Even Lorraine drops her marker. The dome picks up their noise and throws it back, a hundred times larger, until they are laughing at the stars.

MIKA
(wiping her eyes)
Gideon, I think I love you all.

GIDEON
Careful, Mika. That's how they get you.
